Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.09,0:00:09.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, if no one else will say it, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.09,0:00:09.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 如果没有人要说 我来说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.72,0:00:11.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We really suck at paintball.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.72,0:00:11.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们玩彩弹射击真的很烂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:14.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: That was absolutely humiliating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:14.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那真的很丢脸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.93,0:00:18.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Oh, come on. Some battles you win, some battles you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.93,0:00:18.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}少来了 人生有赢也有输
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:23.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Yes, but you don't have to lose to Kyle Bernstein's bar mitzvah party.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:23.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 你不必输给 凯尔柏恩斯汀成年礼的宾客
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:29.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think we have to acknowledge, those were some fairly savage preadolescent Jews.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:29.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我们得知道 他们是野蛮的前青春期犹太人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.53,0:00:33.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, we were annihilated by our own incompetence...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.53,0:00:33.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我们是被自己的无能…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.99,0:00:37.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and the inability of some people to follow the chain of command.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.99,0:00:37.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以及一些人不懂得服从命令 而被歼灭的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.24,0:00:38.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.24,0:00:38.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 别说了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:43.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I wanna talk about the fact that Wolowitz shot me in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我要谈谈沃洛维茨 朝我背后开枪的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.63,0:00:47.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I shot you for a good reason. You were leading us into disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.63,0:00:47.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会对你开枪是有原因的 你带领我们走向灾难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.26,0:00:50.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was giving clear, concise orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.26,0:00:50.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我下的命令清楚而理性
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.55,0:00:52.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You hid behind a tree yelling:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.55,0:00:52.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你躲在树后大叫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.14,0:00:55.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Get the kid in the yarmulke! Get the kid in the yarmulke!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.14,0:00:55.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“杀了那个 戴犹太圆顶小帽的孩子！”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.14,0:00:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, hey, guys. -Oh, hey, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.14,0:00:56.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-大家好 -佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.76,0:00:58.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hello. -Morning, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.76,0:00:58.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 -早安 女士
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.48,0:01:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how was paintball? Did you have fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.48,0:01:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}漆弹怎么样？你们玩得开心吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.69,0:01:05.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure, if you consider being fragged by your own troops fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.69,0:01:05.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然 如果你认为被自己的队友偷袭 会让人开心的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:09.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You clear a space on your calendar. There will be an inquiry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:09.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得空出时间 我们要进行侦讯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.24,0:01:11.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Um....
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.24,0:01:11.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.53,0:01:14.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm having a party on Saturday, so if you're around, come by.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.53,0:01:14.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}星期六我要办派对 你们可以过来玩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.53,0:01:15.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-A party? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.53,0:01:15.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-派对？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.87,0:01:18.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A boy-girl party?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.87,0:01:18.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}男生加女生的派对？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:22.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There will be boys and there will be girls...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:22.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会有男生跟女生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.37,0:01:24.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and it is a party, so....
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.37,0:01:24.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且那的确是派对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:27.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just a bunch of my friends, have some beer, do a little dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:27.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是邀请我朋友过来喝酒跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:28.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Dancing? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:28.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-跳舞？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.55,0:01:30.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I don't know, Penny-- -Thing is, we're not--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.55,0:01:30.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不知道 佩妮 -重点是我们不…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:32.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-We're really more of a-- -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:32.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们比较… -不了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.05,0:01:36.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But thanks. Thanks for thinking of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.05,0:01:36.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你邀请我们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.26,0:01:37.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you sure? It's Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.26,0:01:37.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你确定？那天是万圣节
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.06,0:01:39.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A Halloween party?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.06,0:01:39.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}万圣节派对？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:41.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As in costumes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:41.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要变装吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.18,0:01:42.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.18,0:01:42.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:53.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is there a theme?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:53.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有主题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.07,0:01:54.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, yeah, Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.07,0:01:54.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 万圣节
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:58.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but are the costumes random or genre-specific?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 是随意着装还是有特定的流派？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.91,0:02:01.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As usual, I'm not following.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.91,0:02:01.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还是听不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:04.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's asking if we can come as anyone from science fiction...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:04.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他问我们能不能扮演科幻片里的人物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:06.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...fantasy.... -Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:06.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-幻想角色 -没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:07.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Comic books? -Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:07.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-漫画书人物？ -可以
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.71,0:02:09.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Anime? -Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.71,0:02:09.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-动画人物？ -当然
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.34,0:02:11.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}TV, film, D&amp;D, manga. Greek, Roman, Norse gods--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.34,0:02:11.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}电视、电影、电玩、漫画 希腊、罗马跟北欧天神
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:13.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:13.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们爱扮什么都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.17,0:02:16.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay? Any costume you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.17,0:02:16.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吗？什么服装都行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.10,0:02:18.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.10,0:02:18.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.35,0:02:23.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gentlemen, to the sewing machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.35,0:02:23.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}男士们 朝裁缝机进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:48.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.04,0:02:50.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.04,0:02:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我来开！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:02.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Psshoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.60,0:03:07.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.60,0:03:07.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.48,0:03:09.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.48,0:03:09.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.82,0:03:14.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Make way for the fastest man alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.82,0:03:14.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别挡住全世界最快的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.32,0:03:15.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.32,0:03:15.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.82,0:03:18.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, this is why I wanted to have a costume meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.82,0:03:18.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看吧 所以我说我们得开变装会议
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:21.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We all have other costumes. We can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:21.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们都准备了其他服装 可以再换一套
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:24.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or we could walk right behind each other all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:24.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或者我们可以整晚排成一列走在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.37,0:03:27.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It'll look like one person going really fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.37,0:03:27.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那看起来就像一个走得很快的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:35.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:35.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.76,0:03:39.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a boy-girl party, this Flash runs solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.76,0:03:39.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是男生加女生的派对 只能有一个闪电侠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.55,0:03:43.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, how about this? Nobody gets to be the Flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.55,0:03:43.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 干脆这样吧 大家都不扮闪电侠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.10,0:03:44.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We all change. Agreed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.10,0:03:44.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们都去换衣服 同意吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:47.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ALL: Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:47.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}同意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.85,0:03:50.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I call Frodo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.85,0:03:50.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要扮弗罗多！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.23,0:03:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ALL: Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.23,0:03:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:04:00.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:04:00.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.99,0:04:05.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry I'm late, but my hammer got stuck in the door on the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.99,0:04:05.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉我迟到了 我的锤子被公交车门卡住
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:08.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You went with Thor? -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:08.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你扮雷神？ -怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.33,0:04:11.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just because I'm Indian, I can't be a Norse god?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.33,0:04:11.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是印度人 就不能扮北欧天神吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.38,0:04:14.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no, Raj has to be an Indian god.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.38,0:04:14.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 拉吉得扮印度神
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:15.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's racism.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:15.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是种族歧视
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:19.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, look at Wolowitz. He's not English, but he's dressed like Peter Pan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:19.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看沃洛维茨 他不是英国人 但他扮演彼得潘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.26,0:04:24.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon is neither sound nor light, but he's obviously the Doppler effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.26,0:04:24.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿不像光也不像声音 但他要扮都卜勒效应
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:33.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm not Peter Pan, I'm Robin Hood. -Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:33.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不是彼得潘 我是罗宾汉 -真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.56,0:04:36.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because I saw Peter Pan and you're dressed exactly like Cathy Rigby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.56,0:04:36.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我看过《彼得潘》 你真的很像凯西里格比
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.40,0:04:42.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She was a little bigger than you, but it's basically the same look, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.40,0:04:42.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她的个子比你魁梧 但基本上样子差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:46.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, there's something I wanna talk to you about before we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:46.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 在出发之前 我要跟你谈一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.37,0:04:50.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care if anybody gets it, I'm going as the Doppler effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.37,0:04:50.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不在乎大家能不能明白 我都要扮都卜勒效应
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.92,0:04:55.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No, it's not that-- -If I have to, I can demonstrate: Vroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.92,0:04:55.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不 那不是… -有必要的话我可以演示
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.26,0:05:00.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Terrific. Um....
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.26,0:05:00.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.18,0:05:03.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This party is my first chance for Penny...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.18,0:05:03.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个派对是我第一次有机会让佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.76,0:05:06.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to see me in the context of her social group...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.76,0:05:06.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在她的社交圈里跟我见面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:09.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I need you not to embarrass me tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:09.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今晚我需要你别丢我的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.89,0:05:12.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What exactly do you mean by embarrass you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.89,0:05:12.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你那么说是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.77,0:05:19.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For example, tonight, no one needs to know that my middle name is Leakey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.77,0:05:19.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比如说 今晚大家不必知道 我的中间名叫利奇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.19,0:05:21.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But there's nothing embarrassing about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.19,0:05:21.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但那一点都不丢脸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:24.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your father worked with Louis Leakey, a great anthropologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:24.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你爸跟路易斯利奇合作 他是伟大的人类学家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.74,0:05:27.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It had nothing to do with your bed-wetting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.74,0:05:27.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这跟你会尿床没有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.87,0:05:31.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All I'm saying is that this party is the perfect opportunity...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.87,0:05:31.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说这个派对是个大好机会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:35.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...for Penny to see me as a member of her peer group...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:35.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮可以把我看作 她同龄群体里的一员
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.13,0:05:38.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...a potential close friend and perhaps more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.13,0:05:38.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}潜在的好朋友 也许更进一步
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.84,0:05:42.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't wanna look like a dork.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.84,0:05:42.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想被人当呆子看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:54.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just a heads up, fellas, if anyone gets lucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:54.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听我说 如果有人运气不错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.94,0:05:57.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I've got a dozen condoms in my quiver.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.94,0:05:57.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在箭袋里放了一打保险套
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.11,0:06:00.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.11,0:06:00.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:02.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, sorry we're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:02.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉我们迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.65,0:06:04.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Late? It's 7:05.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.65,0:06:04.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}迟到？现在才七点五分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.66,0:06:06.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you said the party starts at 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.66,0:06:06.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说派对七点开始
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.87,0:06:12.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I mean, when you start a party at 7, no one shows up at, you know, 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.87,0:06:12.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 虽然派对七点开始 没有人会七点就到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.21,0:06:14.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's 7:05.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.21,0:06:14.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}已经七点五分了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.96,0:06:17.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.96,0:06:17.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:19.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, um, come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:19.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.89,0:06:30.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What, are all the girls in the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.89,0:06:30.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么？女生都在浴室里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.81,0:06:33.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Probably, but in their own homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.81,0:06:33.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许吧 在她们家的浴室里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.81,0:06:37.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what time does the costume parade start?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.81,0:06:37.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}变装游行什么时候开始？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.11,0:06:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The parade?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.11,0:06:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}游行？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.48,0:06:42.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, so the judges can give out the prizes for best costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.48,0:06:42.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 评审才能选出最佳服装奖
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.48,0:06:44.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Most frightening, most authentic...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.48,0:06:44.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最可怕、最逼真…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:48.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...most accurate visualization of a scientific principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:48.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最精确的科学原理呈现
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.91,0:06:51.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Sheldon, I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.91,0:06:51.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.49,0:06:55.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but there aren't gonna be any parades or judges or prizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.49,0:06:55.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但不会有游行、评审或奖品
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:06:59.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This party is just going to suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:06:59.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个派对一定会很差劲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:02.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, come on, it's gonna be fun. And you all look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:02.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 别这样 会很好玩的 你们看起来都很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:05.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, look at you, Thor, and, oh, Peter Pan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:05.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说 看看你们 雷神跟彼得潘
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:07.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:07.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.80,0:07:11.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Actually, Penny, he's Robin-- -I'm Peter Pan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.80,0:07:11.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-佩妮 事实上他是罗宾… -我是彼得潘
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.72,0:07:15.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I've got a handful of pixie dust with your name on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.72,0:07:15.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有一把星尘 上面写了你的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.77,0:07:17.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.77,0:07:17.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.61,0:07:24.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, what's Sheldon supposed to be? -Oh, he's the Doppler effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.61,0:07:24.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿是什么？ -他是都卜勒效应
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:27.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, it's the apparent change in the frequency of a wave...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:27.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 那是光波来源跟观察者间
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.36,0:07:31.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...caused by relative motion between the source of the wave and the observer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.36,0:07:31.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}相对动作所导致的频率的明显变化
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.91,0:07:36.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, sure, I see it now. The Doppler effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.91,0:07:36.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然 我知道了 都卜勒效应
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.79,0:07:40.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, I gotta shower. You guys, um, make yourselves comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.79,0:07:40.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我得冲个澡 你们自便
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.84,0:07:42.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.84,0:07:42.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.55,0:07:46.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See? People get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.55,0:07:46.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看吧？大家都明白
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.47,0:07:55.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[MUSIC PLAYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:07:57.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CHATTERING]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.81,0:08:03.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mm. By Odin's beard, this is good Chex Mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.81,0:08:03.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以欧丁的胡子发誓 这个零食真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.27,0:08:04.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, thanks. Peanuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.27,0:08:04.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 谢谢 有花生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:07.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't afford to swell up in these tights.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:07.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想穿着紧身裤还全身发肿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.03,0:08:09.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.03,0:08:09.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我被弄糊涂了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:12.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If there's no costume parade, what are we doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:12.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有变装游行 我们来这里做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.95,0:08:16.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're socializing, meeting new people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.95,0:08:16.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们跟新朋友社交
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:18.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Telepathically?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:18.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用心电感应吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:22.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, hey. When did you get here? WOMAN: Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:22.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你什么时候来的？ -嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:25.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny is wearing the worst Catwoman costume I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:25.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮穿着的是我看过最糟糕的猫女装
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.76,0:08:27.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that includes Halle Berry's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.76,0:08:27.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那包括哈莉贝瑞在内
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.76,0:08:30.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's not Catwoman. She's just a generic cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.76,0:08:30.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是猫女 她只是普通的猫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:32.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that's the kind of sloppy costuming...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:32.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会出现那样的烂服装…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.80,0:08:36.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which results from a lack of rules and competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.80,0:08:36.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是因为缺乏规定和竞争
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.35,0:08:40.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, guys, check out the sexy nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.35,0:08:40.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 看看那个性感俏护士
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.77,0:08:46.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I believe it's time for me to turn my head and cough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.77,0:08:46.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我相信我该转头咳嗽了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.98,0:08:50.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What is your move? -I'm going to use the mirror technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.98,0:08:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你想怎么做？ -我要使用映现技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.49,0:08:53.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She brushes her hair back, I brush mine. She shrugs, I shrug.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.49,0:08:53.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她梳头发 我也梳头发 她耸肩 我也耸肩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.49,0:08:57.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Subconsciously, she's thinking, "We're in sync. We belong together."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.49,0:08:57.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在潜意识里她会认为 我们动作一样 我们该在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:08:59.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where do you get this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:08:59.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么知道那一招？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.50,0:09:02.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, psychology journals, Internet research.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.50,0:09:02.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}心理学期刊 网络搜索
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.50,0:09:06.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And there's this great show on VH1 about how to pick up girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.50,0:09:06.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}VH1有个不错的节目 教人怎么跟女生搭讪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.01,0:09:11.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, if only I had his confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.01,0:09:11.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可惜我不像他那么有自信
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:13.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have such difficulty speaking to women...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:13.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没办法跟女人说话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.59,0:09:17.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or around women, or at times even effeminate men.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.59,0:09:17.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是跟女人在一起 有时候包括娘娘腔的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.39,0:09:21.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If that's a working stethoscope...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.39,0:09:21.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果那个听诊器真的有用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.27,0:09:23.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...maybe you'd like to hear my heart skip a beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.27,0:09:23.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许你该听听我的心跳漏了一拍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.69,0:09:26.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.69,0:09:26.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.11,0:09:29.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, seriously, you can. I have transient idiopathic arrhythmia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.11,0:09:29.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 你真的可以 我有暂时性原发心律不整
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.53,0:09:31.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[UNDER THE INFLUENCE OF GIANTS' "GOT NOTHING" PLAYS ON STEREO]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.74,0:09:33.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So take my money
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.28,0:09:36.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Take my money
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.33,0:09:39.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wanna get to know Penny's friends. I just....
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.33,0:09:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想认识佩妮的朋友 可我…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:41.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know how to talk to these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:41.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道怎么跟这些人说话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:45.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, I actually might be able to help. -How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:45.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-或许我能帮上忙 -怎么说？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.96,0:09:48.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like Jane Goodall observing the apes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.96,0:09:48.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像是珍妮古道尔观察猩猩一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.63,0:09:52.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I initially saw their interactions as confusing and unstructured.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.63,0:09:52.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一开始以为他们的互动 混乱又没有结构
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.51,0:09:53.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But patterns emerge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.51,0:09:53.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但还是有模式可循
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.72,0:09:57.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They have their own language, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.72,0:09:57.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以说 他们有自己的语言
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.10,0:09:59.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.10,0:09:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}继续说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.64,0:10:03.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it seems that the newcomer approaches the existing group...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.64,0:10:03.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来加入新团体的成员
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:05.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with the greeting, "How wasted am I?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:05.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最棒的打招呼方式是 “我喝多了吧？”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:09.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which is met with an approving chorus of "Dude."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:09.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后会有人附和说“老兄”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.40,0:10:11.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then what happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.40,0:10:11.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.69,0:10:13.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's as far as I've gotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.69,0:10:13.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只观察到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:16.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:16.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这太可笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:18.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm jumping in. -Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:18.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我要融入这个圈子 -祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.49,0:10:19.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, you're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.49,0:10:19.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 你得跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:22.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I hardly think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:22.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:23.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:23.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.91,0:10:28.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Aren't you afraid I'll embarrass you? -Yes, but I need a wingman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.91,0:10:28.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你不是怕我丢你的脸吗？ -对 但我需要后援
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:31.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, but if we're going to use flight metaphors...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:31.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 如果我们要用飞行比喻
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.17,0:10:35.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'm much more suited to being the guy from the FAA analyzing wreckage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.17,0:10:35.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我比较适合当 联邦航空管理局飞机残骸分析员
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.01,0:10:39.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.01,0:10:39.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi. -Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嗨 -你好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:42.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what are you supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:42.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你扮什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.02,0:10:44.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.02,0:10:44.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.73,0:10:46.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll give you a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.73,0:10:46.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我给你一个提示
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.06,0:10:48.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Vroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.73,0:10:51.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A choo-choo train?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.73,0:10:51.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}玩具火车？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.40,0:10:53.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.40,0:10:53.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很接近！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.49,0:10:55.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Vroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.40,0:10:57.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A brain-damaged choo-choo train?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.40,0:10:57.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}脑残的玩具火车？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.78,0:11:02.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How wasted am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.78,0:11:02.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喝多了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.00,0:11:04.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dancing all by myself
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.79,0:11:08.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cannot control the beat When you make me weak
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.50,0:11:10.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Vroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.71,0:11:12.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[UNDER THE INFLUENCE OF GIANTS' "MAMA'S ROOM" PLAYS ON STEREO]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.71,0:11:13.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还是不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.80,0:11:13.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I still don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.88,0:11:15.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm the Doppler effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.88,0:11:15.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是都卜勒效应
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.80,0:11:18.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, if that is some sort of learning disability...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.80,0:11:18.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 如果那是种学习障碍
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.39,0:11:20.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I think it's very insensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.39,0:11:20.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得你这么做很无情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.85,0:11:24.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you just tell people you're a zebra?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.85,0:11:24.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么不告诉大家你是斑马？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.27,0:11:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you just tell people you're one of the seven dwarves?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.27,0:11:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么不告诉大家 你是七个小矮人之一？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:29.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because I'm Frodo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:29.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我是弗罗多
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.77,0:11:32.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, well, I'm the Doppler effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.77,0:11:32.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 那我是都卜勒效应
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.69,0:11:35.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, no. -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.69,0:11:35.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不会吧 -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.11,0:11:37.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's Penny's ex-boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.11,0:11:37.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是佩妮的前男友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.99,0:11:39.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you suppose he's doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.99,0:11:39.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得他来这里做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.86,0:11:43.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Besides disrupting the local gravity field.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.86,0:11:43.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除了干扰本地的引力场
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:46.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If he were any bigger, he'd have moons orbiting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:46.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他长得再魁梧一点 就会有一堆卫星绕着他公转
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:49.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, snap. -Ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:49.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:52.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I guess we'll be leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:52.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我们该离开了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.21,0:11:54.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why should we leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.21,0:11:54.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么我们要离开？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.13,0:11:57.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For all we know, he crashed the party and Penny doesn't even want him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.13,0:11:57.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就我们所知他是不请自来 佩妮根本不希望他出现
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.47,0:12:01.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have a backup hypothesis?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.47,0:12:01.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有备用假设吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.01,0:12:04.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe they just wanna be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.01,0:12:04.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许他们只想当朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.52,0:12:08.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or maybe she wants to be friends and he wants something more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.52,0:12:08.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许她要当朋友 而他有别的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.60,0:12:10.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then he and I are on equal ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.60,0:12:10.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 那他跟我算是平手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.52,0:12:13.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but you're much closer to it than he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.52,0:12:13.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 但你比他更接近
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.11,0:12:19.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, if this was 15,000 years ago, by virtue of his size and strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.11,0:12:19.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 如果这是一万五千年前 从他的体型跟力量来判断
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.45,0:12:22.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Kurt would be entitled to his choice of female partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.45,0:12:22.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}库尔特是有权利选择女伴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.32,0:12:25.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And male partners, animal partners, large primordial eggplants...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.32,0:12:25.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}男伴、动物伴侣、巨型原始茄子…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:28.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...pretty much whatever tickled his fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:28.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所有他幻想中会出现的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.62,0:12:31.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but our society has undergone a paradigm shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.62,0:12:31.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我们的社会已经变了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.42,0:12:35.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In the information age, Sheldon, you and I are the alpha males.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.42,0:12:35.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 在信息时代 你跟我才是优秀男性
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.84,0:12:38.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-And we shouldn't have to back down. -True.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.84,0:12:38.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们不该退缩 -没错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.51,0:12:41.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you text him that and see if he backs down?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.51,0:12:41.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么不发短信给他 看他会不会退缩？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.39,0:12:44.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.39,0:12:44.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.06,0:12:48.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm going to assert my dominance face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.06,0:12:48.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要跟他面对面确立我的控制权
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.27,0:12:49.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Face to face?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.27,0:12:49.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}面对面？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.52,0:12:53.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you gonna wait for him to sit down or you gonna stand on the coffee table?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.52,0:12:53.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是要等他坐下来 还是你要站在茶几上？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:56.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, Penny. Hello, Kurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:56.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 佩妮 你好 库尔特
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.61,0:12:58.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hey, guys. You having a good time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.61,0:12:58.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们好 你们玩得开心吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.57,0:13:00.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Given the reaction to my costume...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.57,0:13:00.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根据我服装引起的反应…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:04.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...this party is a scathing indictment of the American education system.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:04.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个派对严厉地指出了 美国教育体系的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:06.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? You're a zebra, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:06.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？你是斑马 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.41,0:13:09.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yet another child left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.41,0:13:09.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又是一个被拉下的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:12.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And what are you supposed to be, an elf?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:12.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是什么？精灵吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.88,0:13:14.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm a hobbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.88,0:13:14.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我是霍比特人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:15.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:15.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那有什么差别？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.71,0:13:18.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A hobbit is a mortal, halfling inhabitant of Middle-earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.71,0:13:18.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍比特人是住在中土世界的半人类
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:22.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...whereas an elf is an immortal, tall warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:22.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}精灵是不死的高大战士
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.18,0:13:25.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So why the hell would you wanna be a hobbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.18,0:13:25.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那为什么你要当霍比特人？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:29.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because he's neither tall nor immortal, and none of us could be the Flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:29.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为他不高 也不是不死人 我们都不能扮闪电侠
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.73,0:13:34.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, whatever. Why don't you go hop off on a quest? I'm talking to Penny here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.73,0:13:34.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}随便吧 你为什么不去探险呢？ 我在跟佩妮说话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.94,0:13:36.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think we're all talking to Penny here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.94,0:13:36.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我们都在跟佩妮说话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.07,0:13:38.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not. No offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.07,0:13:38.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是 没有恶意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:41.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, maybe you didn't hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:41.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 或许你没听清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:43.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Go away. -All right, Kurt, be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:43.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-走开 -库尔特 礼貌一点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.57,0:13:46.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I am being nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.57,0:13:46.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很有礼貌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.32,0:13:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right, little buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.32,0:13:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对吧 小兄弟？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.28,0:13:50.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Kurt. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.28,0:13:50.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-库尔特 -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.87,0:13:54.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I understand your impulse to try to physically intimidate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.87,0:13:54.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我了解到你有冲动 想要在肢体上吓唬我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:57.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't compete with me on an intellectual level...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:57.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在智商上你比不上我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.21,0:14:00.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and so you're driven to animalistic puffery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.21,0:14:00.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你只能用动物性蛮力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.17,0:14:02.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You calling me a puffy animal?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.17,0:14:02.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你骂我是动物？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:03.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:03.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然不是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:06.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, he's not. You're not, right, Leonard?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:06.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 他不是 你不是这么说吧 莱纳德？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.93,0:14:09.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I said animalistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.93,0:14:09.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我是说动物性
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.52,0:14:11.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course, we're all animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.52,0:14:11.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然我们都是动物
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:14.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but some of us have climbed a little higher on the evolutionary tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但有些人在进化中 爬得比其他人高
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.73,0:14:16.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If he understands that, you're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.73,0:14:16.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果他听得懂 你的麻烦就大了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.06,0:14:19.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So what? I'm unevolved?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.06,0:14:19.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以呢？我没有进化吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.11,0:14:20.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.11,0:14:20.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你麻烦大了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.28,0:14:24.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, you use a lot of big words for such a little dwarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.28,0:14:24.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你这个矮冬瓜 倒是挺会说狠话的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.78,0:14:25.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Kurt, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.78,0:14:25.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 库尔特 拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.99,0:14:27.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, Penny, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.99,0:14:27.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 佩妮 没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:28.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:28.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我自己搞得定
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.49,0:14:32.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am not a dwarf, I'm a hobbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.49,0:14:32.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是矮冬瓜 我是霍比特人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.79,0:14:33.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A hobbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.79,0:14:33.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍比特人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:37.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are misfiring neurons in your hippocampus preventing the conversion...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:37.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的海马体神经元失灵让你无法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:39.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...from short-term to long-term memory?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从短期记忆转换成长期记忆吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:41.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[UNDER THE INFLUENCE OF GIANTS' "MEANINGLESS LOVE" PLAYS ON STEREO]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:43.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, now you're starting to make me mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:43.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 你开始惹毛我了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.18,0:14:48.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A Homo habilis discovering his opposable thumbs says, "What?"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.18,0:14:48.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个原始人发现他的拇指方向不一样 于是说“什么？”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.89,0:14:51.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -Ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.89,0:14:51.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.81,0:14:57.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I've made my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.81,0:14:57.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我说得够清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.35,0:15:00.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah? How about I make a point out of your pointy little head?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.35,0:15:00.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？我干脆暴打你一顿 让你更清楚？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.52,0:15:04.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me remind you, while my moral support is absolute, in a physical confrontation...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.52,0:15:04.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得提醒你 我在精神上完全支持你 发生肢体冲突时
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.65,0:15:06.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I will be less than useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.65,0:15:06.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就派不上用场了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.49,0:15:08.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's not going to be a confrontation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.49,0:15:08.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会有肢体冲突的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.62,0:15:12.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In fact, I doubt if he can even spell confrontation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.62,0:15:12.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实我怀疑他会不会写 “肢体冲突”这几个字
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.46,0:15:17.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}C-O-N....
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.46,0:15:17.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}肢…体…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.79,0:15:19.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Frontation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.79,0:15:19.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}冲突
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.96,0:15:23.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Kurt, put him down this instant. -He started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.96,0:15:23.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-库尔特 立刻将他放下来 -是他先惹我的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.21,0:15:26.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care, I'm finishing it. Put him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.21,0:15:26.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不在乎 马上停止 放他下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.26,0:15:27.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.26,0:15:27.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:32.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're one lucky little leprechaun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:32.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是个幸运的小矮人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.31,0:15:35.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's a hobbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.31,0:15:35.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是霍比特人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.18,0:15:37.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.18,0:15:37.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我支持你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.90,0:15:39.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.90,0:15:39.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.23,0:15:41.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, no, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.23,0:15:41.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.36,0:15:43.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't afford you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.73,0:15:47.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a good party. Thanks for having-- It's just getting a little late, so....
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.73,0:15:47.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是很棒的派对 谢谢你邀请我 已经很晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.90,0:15:51.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Okay. All right. Well, thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.90,0:15:51.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 谢谢你来参加
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.37,0:15:54.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had nothing to do with
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:55.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Happy Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:55.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}万圣节快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.54,0:16:00.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If it's any consolation...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.54,0:16:00.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果这能安慰你…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.88,0:16:04.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I thought that Homo habilis line really put him in his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.88,0:16:04.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想原始人的行为 证明他真的是原始人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.35,0:16:16.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's that? -Tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.35,0:16:16.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那是什么？ -茶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.77,0:16:17.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When people are upset...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.77,0:16:17.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}人难过的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:21.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the cultural convention is to bring them hot beverages.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:21.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根据文化传统 最好要给他们端热饮料
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.70,0:16:29.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.70,0:16:29.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:33.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You wanna talk about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:33.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要聊一聊吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.49,0:16:35.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.49,0:16:35.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不要 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.37,0:16:38.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"There, there" was really all I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.37,0:16:38.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的只会说“好了”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.12,0:16:43.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Good night, Sheldon. -Good night, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.12,0:16:43.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-晚安 谢尔顿 -晚安 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.05,0:16:48.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.47,0:16:51.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, Leonard? -Hi, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.47,0:16:51.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 莱纳德 -嗨 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.55,0:16:53.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, I just wanted to make sure you were okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.55,0:16:53.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只想确定你没事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.97,0:16:56.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.97,0:16:56.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.27,0:16:59.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am so sorry about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.27,0:16:59.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}发生那件事我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.73,0:17:01.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.73,0:17:01.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是你的错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.52,0:17:04.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, it is. That's why I broke up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.52,0:17:04.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我的错 所以我跟他分手了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.11,0:17:06.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He always does stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.11,0:17:06.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他老爱那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.57,0:17:10.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So why was he at your party?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.57,0:17:10.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么他会来参加你的派对？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.36,0:17:14.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I ran into him last week...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.36,0:17:14.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上星期我遇到他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.78,0:17:18.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and he was just all apologetic about how he's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.78,0:17:18.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他很愧疚 说他变了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.41,0:17:21.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was just going on and on, and I believed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.41,0:17:21.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说个不停 所以我相信了他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.66,0:17:24.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'm an idiot, because I always believe guys like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.66,0:17:24.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是个白痴 我老是那么容易相信那种人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.50,0:17:28.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I can't go back to my party because he's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.50,0:17:28.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不能回去参加我的派对 因为他在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.21,0:17:32.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I know you don't wanna hear this. I'm upset and really drunk and I just wanna....
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.21,0:17:32.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你不想听 我难过又喝醉了 我只想…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.43,0:17:35.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SOBBING]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.44,0:17:43.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.44,0:17:43.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.73,0:17:48.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God, what is wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.73,0:17:48.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 我是怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.48,0:17:49.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing, you're perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.48,0:17:49.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事 你很完美
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.07,0:17:51.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ecch. I'm not perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.07,0:17:51.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不完美
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.61,0:17:52.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.61,0:17:52.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 你是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.78,0:17:57.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You really think so, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.78,0:17:57.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的那么想？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.05,0:18:14.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Penny? -Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.05,0:18:14.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-佩妮 -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.43,0:18:18.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How much have you had to drink tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.43,0:18:18.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你今晚喝了多少酒？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.14,0:18:23.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just...a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.14,0:18:23.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只…非常多
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.23,0:18:28.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you sure that your being drunk and your being angry with Kurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.23,0:18:28.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你确定你喝醉了 还有你生库尔特的气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.23,0:18:30.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...doesn't have something to do with what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.23,0:18:30.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟现在发生的事无关吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.53,0:18:34.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It might.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.53,0:18:34.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可能有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:36.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.99,0:18:38.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boy, you're really smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.99,0:18:38.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 你好聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:41.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I'm a freaking genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:41.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我简直是天才
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.04,0:18:48.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, you are so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.04,0:18:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 你太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.08,0:18:50.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why can't all guys be like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.08,0:18:50.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么其他男人不能跟你一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.09,0:18:55.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because if all guys were like me, the human race couldn't survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.09,0:18:55.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为如果男人都跟我一样 人类就无法生存
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.43,0:19:00.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I should probably go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.43,0:19:00.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:02.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:02.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.57,0:19:13.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.57,0:19:13.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.49,0:19:26.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's right, you saw what you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.49,0:19:26.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 你看到的都是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:30.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's how we roll in the Shire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:30.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们来自夏尔的人就是这么厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.13,0:19:38.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.13,0:19:39.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.34,0:19:39.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.39,0:19:46.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, have you seen Koothrappali?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.39,0:19:46.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看到库萨帕里了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.02,0:19:48.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.02,0:19:48.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.73,0:19:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe the Avengers summoned him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.73,0:19:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许复仇者在召唤他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.48,0:19:55.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's not the Marvel Comics Thor, he's the original Norse god.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.48,0:19:55.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不是漫威漫画里的雷神 他是一般的北欧天神
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:57.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you for the clarification.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:57.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你的指正
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:20:00.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm supposed to give him a ride home. -I'm sure he'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:20:00.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我该让他搭便车回家 -我相信他会没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.95,0:20:03.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He has his hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.95,0:20:03.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他有锤子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.83,0:20:08.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:14.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to say, you are an amazing man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:14.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得说你是个神奇的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.76,0:20:18.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're gentle and passionate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.76,0:20:18.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你温柔又热情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:23.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And, my God, you are such a good listener.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:23.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 你是很棒的倾听者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.38,0:20:56.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}译者： 杨博
